     SUBORDINATE WRITER on DOCUMENT_TYPE: run opus_health_legacy_v4, 1 writer(s), registry/ies HUB_DOCUMENT_BK__CARD_NO, HUB_DOCUMENT_BK__INWARD_ID, HUB_DOCUMENT_BK__OMNI_INWARD_NO -- its value is DISCARDED wherever opus_health_v2 also writes the same key
     SUBORDINATE WRITER on STORAGE_REFERENCE: run opus_health_delta3, 1 writer(s), registry/ies HUB_DOCUMENT_BK__INWARDNO -- its value is DISCARDED wherever opus_health_legacy_v4 also writes the same key
     SUBORDINATE WRITER on RECEIVED_DATE: run opus_health_delta3, 1 writer(s), registry/ies HUB_DOCUMENT_BK__INWARDNO -- its value is DISCARDED wherever opus_health_legacy_v4 also writes the same key
     SUBORDINATE WRITER on DOCUMENT_REFERENCE_NUMBER: run opus_health_legacy_v4, 1 writer(s), registry/ies HUB_DOCUMENT_BK__CARD_NO, HUB_DOCUMENT_BK__INWARD_ID, HUB_DOCUMENT_BK__OMNI_INWARD_NO -- its value is DISCARDED wherever opus_health_v2 also writes the same key
