     STORAGE_REFERENCE                            opus_health_legacy_v4 > opus_health_delta3
     RECEIVED_DATE                                opus_health_legacy_v4 > opus_health_delta3
     DOCUMENT_REFERENCE_NUMBER                    opus_health_v2 > opus_health_legacy_v4
